                                                                            <p class="ni" style="font-size: 12pt; font-style:italic; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top:5px; padding: 0"><a target="_blank" href="https://doi.org/10.53656/math2024-2-1-pro">https://doi.org/10.53656/math2024-2-1-pro</a></p>
                                                                                                          
                                 
