                                            <span class="pages">стр. 111 - 118</span>
                                            <span class="pdf" title="Изтегли PDF"><a href="https://journals.azbuki.bg/mathinfo/properties-and-conjectures-regarding-discrete-renewal-sequences/pdf"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-file-pdf" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                                        <path d="M4 0a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2zm0 1h8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v12a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V2a1 1 0 0 1 1-1"/>
