<p  class="ni">FELLER, W., 1970.<span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-style: italic; "> An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-style: italic; ">,</span> John Wiley and Sons, New York, vol. 2,  \(2^{\text {nd }}\) edition. </p>
